  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Health support to the Gaza crisis.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To respond to the high level of health needs in Gaza in line with World Health Organization request for international Emergency Medical Teams assistance. The expected role of Emergency Medical Teams in Gaza is to support the currently operational facilities with critically required infrastructure, supplies and personnel.</narrative>
  </description>
